	(text_box "LSM6DSV16XTR\n\nSynopsis:\n\n	6-axis inertial measurement unit (IMU)\n\nDatasheet:\n\n	https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/lsm6dsv16x.pdf\n\nVoltage:\n\n	Operation voltage 1.71V to 3.6V.\n\nI2C:\n\n	To select/exploit the I²C interface, the CS line must be tied high (that is, connected to Vdd_IO).\n\n	SCL and SDA should be configured with 10k pull-up resistors to VDD_IO voltage.\n\nSDO / SA0:\n\n	Connect to GND or VDDIO, sets the I2C address bit.\n	Tie to GND = Address 0x6A\n	Tie to VDDIO = Address 0x6B"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
